## Notes: Morph window for OctoWoW: every creature model in the client (16,000+, with 3D previews, bosses and mounts), a character creator, every race, 14,000+ items and 352 item sets. Morph your mount too. Type /dmorph. Needs VanillaHelpers v1.1.0+ (OctoLauncher's vanillaHelpers mod); previews need ClassicAPI.
